<title>USA: Cumberland changes name to Cumberland Tech.</title>
<headline>Cumberland changes name to Cumberland Tech.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cumberland Holdings Inc on Monday changed its name to Cumberland Technologies Inc in order to more effectively describe the company's current and future focus into the technology solutions area, the company said.</p>
<p>Cumberland Technologies, through its wholly owned subsidiary, Software Solutions Inc (SSI) develops, sells and supports software solutions.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
